<title>SINGAPORE: PCI 1996 half year loss narrows.</title>
<headline>PCI 1996 half year loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				1.57   vs    5.68 (loss)</p>
<p>Group shr (cents) (loss) 0.90 vs 0.33 (loss)</p>
<p>    Turnover			     40.22   vs   77.42</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest     0.88   vs    1.89</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		  0.28   vs    0.67</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	    3.12   vs    4.32</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			1.53   vs    5.72</p>
<p>    Tax				     0.02   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    Minorities			   (0.03)  vs    0.04</p>
<p>Note - PCI Ltd makes and sells printed circuit boards, liquid crystal displays, modules and cordless telephones.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703088)</p>
</text>
